#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:1
msgid "E0088"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `guard_redundant_bang`"
msgstr "警告名：`guard_redundant_bang`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:5
msgid ""
"The condition or pattern of a `guard!` is exhaustive, so it cannot fail "
"and the explicitly terminating form is unnecessary."
msgstr ""
"`guard!` の条件またはパターンは網羅的で失敗しないため、明示的に終了する形式は不要です。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:8
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:10
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn identity(value : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  guard! value is result\n"
"  result\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:14
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正方法"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:16
msgid "Replace `guard!` with `guard`."
msgstr "`guard!` を `guard` に置き換えます。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0088.md:18
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn identity(value : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  guard value is result\n"
"  result\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
